{"page":49,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:283","surah":2,"ayah":283,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِن كُنتُمْ عَلَىٰ سَفَرٍ وَلَمْ تَجِدُوا۟ كَاتِبًا فَرِهَـٰنٌ مَّقْبُوضَةٌ ۖ فَإِنْ أَمِنَ بَعْضُكُم بَعْضًا فَلْيُؤَدِّ ٱلَّذِى ٱؤْتُمِنَ أَمَـٰنَتَهُۥ وَلْيَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ رَبَّهُۥ ۗ وَلَا تَكْتُمُوا۟ ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ ۚ وَمَن يَكْتُمْهَا فَإِنَّهُۥٓ ءَاثِمٌ قَلْبُهُۥ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you are on a journey, and cannot find a scribe, something should be handed over as security, but if you decide to trust one another, then let the one who is trusted fulfil his trust; let him be mindful of God, his Lord. Do not conceal evidence: anyone who does so has a sinful heart, and God is fully aware of everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَفَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a journey","transliteration":"safarin","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you find","transliteration":"tajidū","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَاتِبًۭا","en_gloss":"a scribe","transliteration":"kātiban","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَرِهَـٰنٌۭ","en_gloss":"then pledge","transliteration":"farihānun","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّقْبُوضَةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"in hand","transliteration":"maqbūḍatun","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَمِنَ","en_gloss":"entrusts","transliteration":"amina","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَعْضُكُم","en_gloss":"one of you","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَعْضًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) another","transliteration":"baʿḍan","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَلْيُؤَدِّ","en_gloss":"then let discharge","transliteration":"falyu-addi","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱؤْتُمِنَ","en_gloss":"is entrusted","transliteration":"u'tumina","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَمَـٰنَتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his trust","transliteration":"amānatahu","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلْيَتَّقِ","en_gloss":"And let him fear","transliteration":"walyattaqi","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":20,"ar":"رَبَّهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbahu","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تَكْتُمُوا۟","en_gloss":"conceal","transliteration":"taktumū","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the evidence","transliteration":"l-shahādata","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":25,"ar":"يَكْتُمْهَا","en_gloss":"conceals it","transliteration":"yaktum'hā","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فَإِنَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"then indeed he","transliteration":"fa-innahu","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ءَاثِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) sinful ","transliteration":"āthimun","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":28,"ar":"قَلْبُهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"his heart","transliteration":"qalbuhu","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":30,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":31,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":32,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"2:283"},{"pos":33,"ar":"٢٨٣","en_gloss":"(283)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:283"}]},{"verse_key":"2:284","surah":2,"ayah":284,"ar_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَإِن تُبْدُوا۟ مَا فِىٓ أَنفُسِكُمْ أَوْ تُخْفُوهُ يُحَاسِبْكُم بِهِ ٱللَّهُ ۖ فَيَغْفِرُ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيُعَذِّبُ مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whatever is in the heavens and in the earth belongs to God and, whether you reveal or conceal your thoughts, God will call you to account for them. He will forgive whoever He will and punish whoever He will: He has power over all things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِّلَّهِ","en_gloss":"To Allah (belongs)","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُبْدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you disclose","transliteration":"tub'dū","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تُخْفُوهُ","en_gloss":"you conceal it","transliteration":"tukh'fūhu","verse_key":"2:284"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُحَاسِبْكُم","en_gloss":"will call you to account","transliteration":"yuḥāsib'kum","verse_ke